Title: What They Called Recovery
Credit: Animated feature screenplay — individual review draft
Author: Christopher Kokkinos
Draft date: 2026-09-28
Status: Individual scene draft; whole-film pass provisionally accepted, individual author review pending

INT. VOSS AND VALE'S WORKROOM/ELIAS'S CAR - DAY

An image of three messages reaches Voss from an unknown number. Jackie says she was forced to give the first route, withheld the second, and her siblings are alive. The sender is likely Jackie; the number is not proof by itself.

Elias stops the car before showing Zoe. She reads each message. Her old conclusion about betrayal breaks, but she will not declare the phone safe or the sender authenticated because she wants it to be true.

ZOE
We had a question nobody else would answer right.
